4HypVn8KZRPIlmSobs904dmMAfDIcsEHTmov38A&oe=6AF0B337"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2026-09-10-16h06m05s964.png", "id": "938283189330874", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628456_938283195997540_6272924053038924785_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WZX7B-t_6SsQ7kNvwHKjZSH&_nc_oc=Adr_v7baLAE7MDgztIbP_CJENUe3WQvQmU1D3sQun9h2__psZIFTaINgUg8foUUWvBU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRe9qJpRMnMZcmrVtMoG593Qo0VlSUQ9e3ATHAH4X0m4g&oe=6AF0B078"}, {"file_name": "vlcsnap-2026-09-10-16h03m43s916.png", "id": "1400336194758972", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628875_1400336198092305_6619939636619977328_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2i1IeT5nZ2kQ7kNvwG_nMWK&_nc_oc=AdqtpRklzLBd_cGDb56i5iXtwde3AVm38yFjIoH3X6qbr1r7n_Bb2lGaPjxii03euz8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRJKmNqEUEAj-2h3s8qKApEc4rAqbvtR4cMqjqd6J3mbw&oe=6AF0910D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Model Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "MATHEMATICS\nForty-one space curves in a coordinate box, each casting a dotted shadow onto all three walls. Viviani's curve makes the case alone: one curve whose three shadows are a circle, a parabola and a figure-eight. Twelve surfaces too \u2014 the plaster models this room is named after: a M\u00f6bius strip with one side, a Klein bottle with no inside.\n\nCHEMISTRY\nFifty structures in the CPK colours chemists read without thinking, as ball-and-stick or space-filling. Methane's real 109.47\u00b0 tetrahedron, which a flat cross drawing makes look like 90\u00b0.\n\nSPACE\nNine bodies, each as itself, as its system, or opened along the equator. Jupiter's moons in their exact 1:2:4 resonance. And the galaxy they sit in, with the Sun 26,700 light years out. Step inside, and it becomes the room you are standing in.\n\nANATOMY\nFifteen organs from BodyParts3D \u2014 one adult body segmented from MRI. Nothing is scaled to fit: every organ the size it is, in the place it is, with the ducts that join them.\n\nSOURCED, NOT SKETCHED\nBond lengths from published experimental structures; interior boundaries from seismology and spacecraft. Organ measurements are computed from the mesh on screen, so no entry can quote a size its own geometry does not have.\n\nIN YOUR ROOM\nThe model stands on your own table in passthrough. Hands or controllers. Drag to turn it; one button puts it back square.\n\nForty-seven entries are free, and every category opens with one. One purchase unlocks the rest permanently \u2014 no subscription.", "short_description": "Some shapes survive being drawn flat. Most of the interesting ones don't.\n\nModel Room stands 129 models in your own room at true scale: mathematical surfaces, molecules, planetary interiors, human organs, and the Milky Way you can step inside. A Klein bottle with no inside. Benzene at its measured bond angles. The liver sitting on the right kidney, at the size it actually is.\n\nEvery geometry is computed from published data, and every entry says what a flat picture gets wrong."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tools.justinzheng.com/modelroomprivacypolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Fan Zhou", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tools.justinzheng.com/modelroom.html", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "ST